'''Ants''' are a [[Mob]] that can be found in {{Zone|Ant's Cave}}.

== Spawning ==
'''Ants''' spawn throughout {{Zone|Ant's Cave}}. Additionally, {{Green|2}}-{{Green|4}} '''Ants''' spawn when breaking an [[Ant Hill]].

== Behavior ==
'''Ants''' can only be damaged with a [[Vacuum]] due to being a {{mt|Pest}}. If a {{MobSprite|Queen Ant}} spawns with a group of '''Ants''', the {{MobSprite|Queen Ant}} becomes immune to damage until the '''Ants''' are killed.

